  Name: Outer Cloth Cover
  Text: "The R series airship\u2019s outer cloth cover was made from a doped cotton
    fabric that was specially treated for durability and weatherproofing.  The cloth
    had \u201Creefing booms\u201D which ran symmetrically through the cloth from
    end to end of the airship. "
